**MOVEMENT & POSITIONING:**
{{- if and (not .State.IsDocked) (not .State.Traveling)}• `travel poi_id=<ID>` - Travel to a POI in current system (requires fuel)
{{- if and (not .State.IsDocked) (not .State.Traveling)}}• `jump system_name=<NAME>` - Jump to connected star system (requires fuel, must be at jump gate)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `undock` - Leave current station
{{end}}

**RESOURCE GATHERING:**
{{- if and (not .State.IsDocked) (not .State.Traveling)}}• `mine` - Extract resources at current location (requires mining laser, must be at asteroid belt/field)
{{- if and (not .State.IsDocked) (not .State.Traveling)}}• `scan` - Scan current area (requires scanner module)
{{end}}

**COMBAT:**
{{- if and (not .State.IsDocked) (not .State.Traveling)}}• `attack target_id=<ID>` - Engage hostile player (requires weapons, must be at same POI)
{{- if and (not .State.IsDocked) (not .State.Traveling)}}• `cloak` - Activate cloaking device (requires cloak module)
{{end}}

**STATION INTERACTION:**
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `dock` - Dock at current station (if not already docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `sell item_id=<ID> quantity=<N>` - Sell specific items (must be docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `sell_all` - Sell all cargo items at once (must be docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `buy item_id=<ID> quantity=<N>` - Purchase items from market (must be docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `get_listings` - Check market prices (must be docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `get_ships` - Check available ships (must be docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `buy_ship ship_class=<CLASS>` - Buy new ship (must be docked, old ship sold for 50% value)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `install module_id=<ID>` - Install module from cargo (must be docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `uninstall module_id=<ID>` - Remove module (must be docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `refuel` - Refill fuel tank (must be docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `repair` - Repair hull damage (must be docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `view_storage` - View station storage (must be docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `deposit_items item_id=<ID> quantity=<N>` - Store items in station (must be docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `withdraw_items item_id=<ID> quantity=<N>` - Retrieve items from storage (must be docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `deposit_credits amount=<N>` - Store credits at station (must be docked)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `withdraw_credits amount=<N>` - Retrieve credits from storage (must be docked)
{{end}}

**INFORMATION:**
• `get_status` - Get your current status
• `get_system` - Get current system details (POIs, connections)
• `get_poi poi_id=<ID>` - Get detailed POI information
• `get_nearby` - Get nearby players
• `scan target_id=<ID>` - Scan target player (requires scanner)
{{end}}

**MARKET ORDERS (if available):**
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `create_sell_order item_id=<ID> quantity=<N> price_each=<N>` - List items for sale (escrows credits)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `create_buy_order item_id=<ID> quantity=<N> price_each=<N>` - List wanted-to-buy (escrows credits)
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `view_orders` - View your active orders
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `cancel_order order_id=<ID>` - Cancel an order
