**MARKET ARBITRAGE:**
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `analyze_market item_id=<ID>` - Analyze market prices for an item across systems
{{- if .State.IsDocked}}• `find_route target_system=<NAME>` - Find shortest route to destination
{{end}}

**WRECK SALVAGING:**
{{- if and (not .State.IsDocked) (not .State.Traveling)}}• `get_wrecks` - List ship wrecks at current POI
{{- if and (not .State.IsDocked) (not .State.Traveling)}}• `get_base_wrecks` - List base wrecks at current POI
{{- if and (not .State.IsDocked) (not .State.Traveling)}}• `loot_wreck wreck_id=<ID> item_id=<ID> quantity=<N>` - Loot specific item from wreck
