**PLAYER INTERACTION:**
• `chat channel=<CH> content=<TEXT>` - Send chat message (channels: system, local, faction, private)
• `send_gift recipient=<NAME> item_id=<ID> quantity=<N> credits=<N> message=<TEXT>` - Send items/credits to another player
• `trade_offer target_id=<ID> items=<JSON> credits=<N>` - Offer trade to another player
• `trade_accept trade_id=<ID>` - Accept trade offer
• `trade_decline trade_id=<ID>` - Decline trade offer
{{end}}

**ADVANCED:**
• `wait` - Do nothing this turn (save action, wait for situation to change)
• `set_anonymous enable=<BOOL>` - Toggle anonymous mode
• `set_status status=<TEXT> clan_tag=<TAG>` - Update your status
• `captains_log_add entry=<TEXT>` - Add entry to your personal log
• `captains_log_get index=<N>` - Retrieve log entry
{{end}}
